  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nSTUFFED is a procedurally generated, horde first-person shooter, that takes place in the dreams of a little girl. Play as a teddy bear and fight waves of nightmares as you defend your owner. Play solo or join your friends in up to 4 player online co-op.<p></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Fight the waves of nightmares:</b> Defend your owner’s bedroom door and defeat a variety of nightmares in endless waves. Earn points from defeating nightmares and use them to unlock new map areas and weapons.\n</li><li><b>Unique Weapons:</b> From a popcorn grenade to a jelly bean shotgun, find and use unique weapons made from household objects.\n</li><li><b>Upgrade Your Bear:</b> Earn XP in to unlock special player abilities each game session.\n</li><li><b>Personalize your bear:</b> Use points to unlock new outfits and furs for your teddy bear. Mix and match outfits and furs to fully personalise them.\n</li></ul>\n",
